# grant-narrowing — a narrowed grant scopes authority to kinds (and risk levels);
# a token outside the grant's scope is `refused`. Bare authority is full (SYNTAX §3).
actor a
gate g1 risk low grant a[deploy]
gate g2 risk low grant a[deploy]
gate g3 risk low grant a[deploy:low,medium]
gate g4 risk low grant a[deploy:low,medium]
cord g1 -> master
cord g2 -> master
cord g3 -> master
cord g4 -> master
